1
00:00:00,402 --> 00:00:03,032
(Sheldon:)You continue to underestimate me,
my good man.

2
00:00:03,196 --> 00:00:07,156
(Leonard:)If you weren't happy with my presentation,
then maybe you should've given it with me.

3
00:00:07,326 --> 00:00:11,536
As I've explained repeatedly, unlike you,
I don't need validation from lesser minds.

4
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:14,045
(Leonard:)- No offense.
- Really? So why did you come?

5
00:00:14,207 --> 00:00:16,917
- Because I knew you'd screw this up.
- I didn't screw it up.

6
00:00:17,085 --> 00:00:20,255
(Sheldon:)Oh, please. I admit,
that spherical-chicken joke was hilarious.

7
00:00:20,422 --> 00:00:22,672
- Thank you.
- It was straight downhill from there.

8
00:00:22,841 --> 00:00:24,801
(Leonard:)I've had enough of your condescension.

9
00:00:24,968 --> 00:00:27,678
(Leonard:)Maybe I didn't go to college
when I was 11, like you.

10
00:00:27,846 --> 00:00:31,186
(Leonard:)Maybe I got my doctorate at 24
instead of 16.

11
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:35,350
(Leonard:)But you are not the only person who
is smarter than everyone else in this room.

12
00:00:35,854 --> 00:00:37,854
(Leonard:)No offense.

13
00:00:38,065 --> 00:00:42,025
(Leonard:)And I am clearly not the only person
who is tormented by insecurity...

14
00:00:42,194 --> 00:00:44,444
(Leonard:)...and has an ego
in need of constant validation.

15
00:00:44,613 --> 00:00:47,533
- So you admit you're an egotist.
- Yes.

16
00:00:48,408 --> 00:00:51,618
(Leonard:)My name is Dr. Leonard Hofstadter.
I could never please my parents...

17
00:00:51,787 --> 00:00:54,037
...so I need to get my self-esteem
from strangers.

18
00:00:54,206 --> 00:00:55,286
But he's worse!

19
00:00:55,457 --> 00:00:56,997
(Sheldon:)Okay, that is it.

20
00:00:57,167 --> 00:01:00,027
(Penny:)Stop it.

